  "findings": "Inspected the photographed three heart-shaped leaflets on their own petiole and separate white flower stalks. Replaced the generic flower stem with mid-stem leaves by a low rhizome network carrying independent trifoliate petioles and occasional bare flower peduncles. Reviewed current seeds 1/4/7 and all 36 instances. Corrected baseline to 12 cm; final voxel heights about 7.5-15 cm. At 25 mm this is only three to six cells tall: leaflet notches, pink veins and individual petals cannot remain visible. Accepted as a scale-correct coarse groundcover representation, explicitly not a detailed botanical silhouette at this pitch. The tiny flowers were not enlarged to compensate.",
